        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME. Proposed interactions and technical DTO limits, not an existing deployed endpoint, provider acceptance or approved missing business policy. Every mutation rechecks current session/role/CSRF; user-supplied actor/state is ignored. External delivery/transfer is outside database transactions. Existing ProductOrder supports PICKUP/PAY_AT_SHOP but requires customerId; guest counter orders require a reviewed aggregate extension, never a fabricated Customer account. Counter context/receipt adapter, tier thresholds/rates and phone-link authority remain proposed release gates. Stock source identity is unique; no automatic cash/VietQR acceptance." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
